'''Otto''' served as chauffeur to the [[Chandrilan]] [[banker]] [[Tay Kolma]]<ref name="Harvest" /> in [[4 BBY]].<ref name="S2.1Date">{{Andor|One Year Later}} dates the first arc of [[Andor Season 2|''Andor'' 2]] to [[4 BBY]].</ref> By the third [[Standard day|day]] of [[Stekan Sculdun]] and [[Leida Mothma]]'s [[Wedding of Stekan Sculdun and Leida Mothma|wedding]], Kolma departed the celebration early after conversations with [[Senator]] [[Mon Mothma]], who he was financially backing to support her [[Axis network|rebellious activities]]. Kolma had made it known that his involvement in such affairs was negatively impacting him and causing him grief, leaving Mothma and her collaborator [[Luthen Rael]] concerned. As a result, Otto was replaced by [[Cinta Kaz]], a rebel operative in service of Rael. When Kolma left the [[Mothma Estate]] in a [[speeder]], he asked Kaz where Otto was, and Kaz replied that she did not know and had been called to fill in for them. Kaz then drove Kolma away.<ref name="Harvest" />

